    "message": "feat(context): deterministic bounded context bundles via `ix context`\n\nCompose the existing resolver, fact collector, and /v1/context service\ninto a single deterministic, budgeted context bundle with explicit\ntruncation metadata and provenance. Evidence is ranked by a stable\ntier order (target, structural, claim, decision, conflict, intent,\nrelationship, provenance) with an id tiebreaker, so identical input\nproduces identical output apart from the declared generatedAt field.\n\nAdds the `ix context <target>` command with text/json/llm formats,\n--max-* budgets, --as-of-rev historical context, and staleness\nclassification from collected facts.",
